        "---\n",
        "title: \"Minggu 06: Variabel Acak Diskrit\"\n",
        "subtitle: \"Binomial Distribution, Poisson Distribution\"\n",
        "---\n",
        "\n",
        "# Pendahuluan\n",
        "\n",
        "Baik. Simulasi **Poisson process** sebenarnya sangat sederhana dan sangat bagus untuk membantu mahasiswa memahami konsep **arrival acak** dalam sistem.\n",
        "\n",
        "Kita akan mensimulasikan dua hal:\n",
        "\n",
        "1. **jumlah kejadian dalam waktu tertentu** (Poisson)\n",
        "2. **waktu antar kejadian** (Exponential)\n",
        "\n",
        "Ini langsung menunjukkan hubungan teori yang kita bahas sebelumnya.\n",
        "\n",
        "---\n",
        "\n",
        "## 1. Simulasi Poisson Process dengan Python\n",
        "\n",
        "Ide dasar:\n",
        "\n",
        "* waktu antar kedatangan mengikuti **Exponential**\n",
        "* kita terus menambahkan waktu sampai melewati batas waktu total\n",
        "\n",
        "Contoh: simulasi **request server selama 10 detik**."
      ],
      "id": "45dd08de"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "import numpy as np\n",
        "import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n",
        "\n",
        "## parameter\n",
        "lambda_rate = 2   ## rata-rata 2 request per detik\n",
        "T = 10            ## total waktu simulasi (detik)\n",
        "\n",
        "arrival_times = []\n",
        "t = 0\n",
        "\n",
        "while t < T:\n",
        "    ## generate waktu antar kedatangan\n",
        "    interarrival = np.random.exponential(1/lambda_rate)\n",
        "    t += interarrival\n",
        "    \n",
        "    if t < T:\n",
        "        arrival_times.append(t)\n",
        "\n",
        "print(\"Arrival times:\", arrival_times)\n",
        "print(\"Total arrivals:\", len(arrival_times))\n",
        "print(\"rata-rata\",len(arrival_times)/T )"
      ],
      "id": "036a7c7b",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "Contoh output:\n",
        "\n",
        "```\n",
        "Arrival times: [0.3, 0.7, 1.1, 1.6, ...]\n",
        "Total arrivals: 18\n",
        "```\n",
        "\n",
        "Artinya:\n",
        "\n",
        "selama 10 detik terjadi **18 request**.\n",
        "\n",
        "---\n",
        "\n",
        "## 2. Visualisasi Arrival"
      ],
      "id": "eec5aec8"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "plt.eventplot(arrival_times)\n",
        "plt.xlabel(\"Time\")\n",
        "plt.title(\"Poisson Arrival Process\")\n",
        "plt.show()"
      ],
      "id": "c86d63e3",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "Grafik ini menunjukkan **kedatangan request secara acak sepanjang waktu**.\n",
        "\n",
        "Mahasiswa biasanya langsung memahami bahwa:\n",
        "\n",
        "```text\n",
        "arrival tidak teratur\n",
        "tetapi rata-ratanya stabil\n",
        "```\n",
        "\n",
        "---\n",
        "\n",
        "## 3. Simulasi Distribusi Poisson\n",
        "\n",
        "Sekarang kita simulasi **jumlah kejadian dalam interval waktu tetap**."
      ],
      "id": "7f9e6185"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "lambda_rate = 4   ## rata-rata 4 kejadian\n",
        "samples = np.random.poisson(lambda_rate, 10000)\n",
        "\n",
        "plt.hist(samples, bins=15, density=True)\n",
        "plt.xlabel(\"Number of events\")\n",
        "plt.title(\"Poisson Distribution Simulation\")\n",
        "plt.show()"
      ],
      "id": "be580d94",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "Ini akan menghasilkan histogram yang mengikuti distribusi **Poisson**.\n",
        "\n",
        "---\n",
        "\n",
        "## 4. Simulasi Waiting Time (Exponential)\n",
        "\n",
        "Kita lihat distribusi waktu antar kedatangan."
      ],
      "id": "06bd09fd"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "interarrival = np.random.exponential(1/lambda_rate, 10000)\n",
        "\n",
        "plt.hist(interarrival, bins=50, density=True)\n",
        "plt.xlabel(\"Waiting time\")\n",
        "plt.title(\"Exponential Distribution\")\n",
        "plt.show()"
      ],
      "id": "2a484d7e",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "Mahasiswa akan melihat bahwa:\n",
        "\n",
        "* banyak waktu tunggu **pendek**\n",
        "* beberapa **panjang**\n",
        "\n",
        "Ini ciri khas **exponential distribution**.\n",
        "\n",
        "---\n",
        "\n",
        "## 5. Demonstrasi yang sangat kuat di kelas\n",
        "\n",
        "Anda bisa melakukan eksperimen sederhana:\n",
        "\n",
        "Misalnya untuk **web server**:\n",
        "\n",
        "```python\n",
        "lambda_rate = 5   ## 5 request per detik\n",
        "T = 60            ## simulasi 1 menit\n",
        "```\n",
        "\n",
        "Lalu mahasiswa menghitung:\n",
        "\n",
        "* total request\n",
        "* waktu antar request\n",
        "* distribusi arrival\n",
        "\n",
        "Ini langsung menghubungkan teori:\n",
        "\n",
        "```text\n",
        "Bernoulli → Binomial → Poisson → Exponential\n",
        "```\n",
        "\n",
        "ke **sistem nyata**.\n",
        "\n",
        "---\n",
        "\n",
        "## 6. Simulasi M/M/1 Queue (bonus kecil)\n",
        "\n",
        "Contoh sangat sederhana:"
      ],
      "id": "3ab78433"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "arrival_rate = 2\n",
        "service_rate = 3\n",
        "\n",
        "n = 1000\n",
        "\n",
        "interarrival = np.random.exponential(1/arrival_rate, n)\n",
        "service_time = np.random.exponential(1/service_rate, n)\n",
        "\n",
        "arrival_time = np.cumsum(interarrival)\n",
        "\n",
        "start_service = np.zeros(n)\n",
        "finish_service = np.zeros(n)\n",
        "\n",
        "for i in range(n):\n",
        "    if i == 0:\n",
        "        start_service[i] = arrival_time[i]\n",
        "    else:\n",
        "        start_service[i] = max(arrival_time[i], finish_service[i-1])\n",
        "    \n",
        "    finish_service[i] = start_service[i] + service_time[i]\n",
        "\n",
        "waiting_time = start_service - arrival_time\n",
        "\n",
        "print(\"Average waiting time:\", np.mean(waiting_time))\n"
      ],
      "id": "9caf4ebc",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "import matplotlib.pyplot as plt1, plt2, plt3\n",
        "\n",
        "plt1.eventplot(arrival_time)\n",
        "plt1.title(\"Arrival Time\")\n",
        "\n",
        "plt2.eventplot(start_service)\n",
        "plt2.title(\"Arrival Time\")\n",
        "\n",
        "plt3.eventplot(waiting_time)\n",
        "plt3.title(\"Arrival Time\")\n",
        "\n",
        "plt1.show()\n",
        "plt2.show()\n",
        "plt3.show()"
      ],
      "id": "3b85c322",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "Ini sudah menjadi **simulasi dasar sistem antrian**.\n",
        "\n",
        "---\n",
        "\n",
        "## 7. Insight penting untuk mahasiswa\n",
        "\n",
        "Dengan simulasi ini mahasiswa melihat bahwa:\n",
        "\n",
        "```text\n",
        "random events\n",
        "→ Poisson arrival\n",
        "→ Exponential waiting time\n",
        "→ queueing systems\n",
        "```\n",
        "\n",
        "Ini membuat probabilitas terasa **hidup**, bukan sekadar rumus.\n",
